text Naranja_Norte_G00_M28_Text_0816FF7F {
    "Wahahaha! Today’s technology is a\nwondrous thing!\pTake this volcanic ash here.\nIt can be fashioned into glass."
}

text Naranja_Norte_G00_M28_Text_0816FFEE {
    "It’s fun walking through the volcano’s\nashes on the ground and grass.\pYou can see where you walked - it’s\nreally neat!"
}

text Naranja_Norte_G00_M28_Text_08170065 {
    "ROUTE 113\nワ ROUTE 111"
}

text Naranja_Norte_G00_M28_Text_0817007B {
    "ROUTE 113\nロ FALLARBOR TOWN"
}

text Naranja_Norte_G00_M28_Text_08170096 {
    "TRAINER TIPS\pYou may register one of the KEY ITEMS\nin your BAG as SELECT.\pSimply press SELECT to use the\nregistered item conveniently."
}

text Naranja_Norte_G00_M28_Text_0817011D {
    "GLASS WORKSHOP\n“Turning Volcanic Ash into Glass Items”"
}

text Naranja_Norte_G00_M28_Text_081BB9BA {
    "Can you guess why it’s so cool\naround here?"
}

text Naranja_Norte_G00_M28_Text_081BB9E6 {
    "Peeuuw!\nThat stinks!"
}

text Naranja_Norte_G00_M28_Text_081BB9FB {
    "The volcanic ash blocks the sun, so it\ndoesn’t get very warm.\pThat’s good for me - I can’t stand heat!"
}

text Naranja_Norte_G00_M28_Text_081BBA62 {
    "The volcano’s eruption is proof that\nthe earth is alive."
}

text Naranja_Norte_G00_M28_Text_081BBA9B {
    "You’re some kind of strong!"
}

text Naranja_Norte_G00_M28_Text_081BBAB7 {
    "Ouch! Owww! I can’t see!\nI got ashes in my eyelashes!\pGet it? Ashes and eyelashes?\pOkay, that was bad, sorry..."
}

text Naranja_Norte_G00_M28_Text_081BBC59 {
    "From out of the ashes I leap! Hiyah!\nI challenge thee!"
}

text Naranja_Norte_G00_M28_Text_081BBC90 {
    "With honor I admit defeat!"
}

text Naranja_Norte_G00_M28_Text_081BBCAB {
    "I must refine the art of concealment.\nI bid thee farewell."
}

text Naranja_Norte_G00_M28_Text_081BBCE6 {
    "From out of the ashes I leap! Hiyah!\nI challenge thee!"
}

text Naranja_Norte_G00_M28_Text_081BBD1D {
    "With honor I admit defeat!"
}

text Naranja_Norte_G00_M28_Text_081BBD38 {
    "My flawless concealment was let down\nby my immature battle skills...\pI bid thee farewell."
}

text Naranja_Norte_G00_M28_Text_081BBD92 {
    "Thanks for finding me!\nBut we still have to battle!"
}

text Naranja_Norte_G00_M28_Text_081BBDC6 {
    "I’ll use my ninjutsu on you...\n“VOLCANIC ASH SWIRL CLOAK”!\p...What? It’s already over?"
}

text Naranja_Norte_G00_M28_Text_081BBE1D {
    "You know what’s crummy about hiding?\nIt’s lonely if no one comes along."
}

text Naranja_Norte_G00_M28_Text_081BBE65 {
    "TORI: Both of us, we collect ashes.\nWe battle POKéMON, too."
}

text Naranja_Norte_G00_M28_Text_081BBEA1 {
    "TORI: We lost... It’s boring, so I’m going\nto get some more ashes."
}

text Naranja_Norte_G00_M28_Text_081BBEE4 {
    "TORI: How much ash do we have?\nEnough for a WHITE FLUTE, I hope."
}

text Naranja_Norte_G00_M28_Text_081BBF25 {
    "TORI: We want to battle 2-on-2.\nIf we didn’t, we would lose!"
}

text Naranja_Norte_G00_M28_Text_081BBF62 {
    "TIA: Both of us, we collect ashes.\nWe battle POKéMON, too."
}

text Naranja_Norte_G00_M28_Text_081BBF9D {
    "TIA: We couldn’t win... It’s boring,\nso I’m getting some more ashes."
}

text Naranja_Norte_G00_M28_Text_081BBFE2 {
    "TIA: We have a lot of ashes!\nI think enough for a WHITE FLUTE!"
}

text Naranja_Norte_G00_M28_Text_081BC021 {
    "TIA: We want to battle 2-on-2.\nIf we don’t, we won’t win!"
}

text Naranja_Norte_G00_M28_Text_086B76B3 {
    "¡Estoy sanando a este SEEL!\p¿Me puedes traer\nuna POCIÓN, soci{RIVAL}?\p"
}

text Naranja_Norte_G00_M28_Text_086B76F5 {
    "¡Estoy sanando a este SEEL!\p¿Me trajiste una POCIÓN soci{RIVAL}?\p{PLAYER} dio una POCIÓN\na la ENFERMERA JOY."
}

text Naranja_Norte_G00_M28_Text_086B7757 {
    "SEEL se está tomando la POCIÓN\ny le está haciendo efecto."
}
